# Continuum — repository hygiene
#
# The persistent data roots (/source-vault, /library, /projects, /generated,
# /jobs, /models, /cache) are configured absolute paths OUTSIDE this repository.
# They must never be committed. These entries are a defensive backstop only —
# see docs/ADR/0001-storage-and-source-vault.md.
/source-vault/
# The physical Vault is C:\ContinuumVault, outside this repository. These
# two names are here so that a Vault accidentally created *inside* the
# working tree still cannot be committed. See docs/SOURCE_VAULT_SCAFFOLD.md.
/Vault/
/ContinuumVault/
/library/
/projects/
/generated/
/jobs/
/models/
/cache/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Archives / redistributions of the docs themselves
*.zip

# Toolchain
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
node_modules/
.next/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
